<div class="wrap">
  <div class="sc-head">
    <h1>💫 {{ t('Subsector Confluence · China', '子行业汇聚 · 中国') }} <span style="color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;font-weight:600">同花顺概念</span></h1>
    <div class="asof" id="sc-asof"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="sc-sub">{{ t(
    "Each 同花顺 (Tonghuashun) CONCEPT board as an equal-weight synthetic A-share index, read through the owner's T1-T4 MACD-RSI × StochRSI confluence cascade (the ENTRY gate) and the validated regime state machine (the rotation CONTEXT), benchmarked to CSI 300 (沪深300). <b>ENTRY-NOW</b> = a concept that just fired, or is about to. The <b>double-gate</b> funnels A-shares whose own cascade fires AND whose concept has a tailwind — and flags strong names whose concept is distributing. THS concepts overlap (a stock sits in many), so this is a thematic read, not a sector partition. A risk / rotation-timing map — one door, confirm before acting; not alpha.",
    "将每个同花顺概念板块视作等权合成A股指数，用业主的 T1-T4 MACD-RSI × StochRSI 汇聚级联（入场闸门）与已验证的状态机（轮动背景）解读，基准为沪深300。<b>现可入场</b>=刚触发或即将触发的概念。<b>双重闸门</b>筛出自身级联触发且所在概念顺风的A股，并标记所在概念正在派发的强势股。同花顺概念相互重叠（一只股属于多个概念），故为主题式解读而非行业划分。风险/轮动择时图——仅一道门，行动前请确认；非阿尔法。") }}</div>

